 "Identifica amenazas y vulnerabilidades, estima su probabilidad e impacto y decide cuáles tratar primero.": "Identify threats and vulnerabilities, estimate their likelihood and impact, and decide which to treat first.",
 "Aplica medidas concretas del Anexo A para reducir los riesgos: técnicas, físicas, organizativas y de personas.": "Apply specific Annex A measures to reduce risks: technical, physical, organizational and people-related.",
